# YGOChecker agent rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` first; use skill `ygo-checker` for deck/YGO domain work only when relevant.
- Before commit: `harness validate` + `cd ygo-card-checker && npm test && npm run build`.
- Prefer `/harness:verify` over re-explaining checks. Skip harness skills for trivial doc typos — state skip.
- Never `--no-verify`. Never weaken eslint/prettier configs.
- Minimize tokens: grep targeted paths; don't read `dist/`, `.angular/`, `node_modules/`. Use MCP `yugioh` for card lookups, not full DB dumps.
- Loop state lives in `PROGRESS.md` — update there, not long chat recaps.
- Maker/checker split: after implementation, invoke `verifier` subagent before claiming done.
